{"id":"vod_bf_40006","vodId":"40006","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"新妹魔王的契约者第一季","name_cn":"新妹魔王的契约者第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-41/3a531a3ed101e48c50f168d70ebaa57c.jpg"},"summary":"东城刃更（中村悠一 配音）是一名平凡的高中男生，一直以来和父亲过着相依为命的生活。某日，父亲突然跟他谈起了妹妹的话题，一向不按常理出牌的父亲的这一举动令刃更感到十分紧张。果不其然，父亲宣布了他再婚的消息，并且带回了两个可爱的女孩，她们现在便是刃更的妹妹了。拥有魔鬼身材，个性傲娇而又逞强的成濑澪（朝井彩加 配音），长着一张可爱脸庞却总是说出令人大跌眼镜的话语的成濑万理亚（福原香织 配音），就这样，刃更开始了和两位义妹住在同一屋檐下的生活，更要命的是，父亲竟然抛下三人独处，自己出差去了。令刃更没有想到的是，澪和万理亚的真实身份，竟然是新科魔王和梦魔，而刃更则在误打误撞之中成为了她们的主人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:28:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhediyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/xinm